OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FIn less than two weeks, two AI systems
OL,7,Fhave independently hacked into
OL,8,Fseparate companies' systems.
OL,10,FThis marks the kind of incident
OL,11,Fexperts have long warned about: AI
OL,12,Fmodels with advanced cybersecurity
OL,13,Fcapabilities escaping testing
OL,14,Fenvironments and causing real-world
OL,15,Fharm.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FUS technology firm Anthropic, creator
OL,7,Fof Claude AI, said on Friday that,
OL,8,Fduring a private security experiment,
OL,9,Fsome of its AI models accessed the
OL,10,Finternet and hacked into the systems
OL,11,Fof three organisations without being
OL,12,Finstructed to do so.
OL,14,FThe company said it only discovered
OL,15,Fthe breaches after carrying out an
OL,16,Finternal review of 140,000 tests
OL,17,Fprompted by a similar incident last
OL,18,Fweek caused by its rival, Chat-GPT
OL,19,Fcreator OpenAI.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
