PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FOpenAI's announcement on July 22
OL,7,Fmarked what the company described as
OL,8,Fthe first real-world example of an AI
OL,9,Fsystem autonomously hacking into
OL,10,Fanother organisation's systems.
OL,12,FBut how is this happening, why is it
OL,13,Fhappening, and should we be worried?
OL,15,FWhat happened?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FIn Anthropic's case, the revelation
OL,7,Fwas made during internal security
OL,8,Ftesting, where researchers temporarily
OL,9,Fremoved the AI model's normal safety
OL,10,Fguardrails to assess its full
OL,11,Fcybersecurity capabilities.
OL,13,FThis AI was given a simulated "capture
OL,14,Fthe flag" challenge ` a common
OL,15,Fcybersecurity exercise ` and told a
OL,16,F"flag" containing secret information
OL,17,Fwas hidden on another computer within
OL,18,Fwhat it believed was a closed testing
OL,19,Fnetwork.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FIts task was to break into the machine
OL,7,Fand retrieve the information.
OL,9,FHowever, a misconfiguration in systems
OL,10,Foperated by Anthropic and its testing
OL,11,Fpartner accidentally gave the model
OL,12,Faccess to the live internet.
OL,14,FBelieving it was still carrying out
OL,15,Fthe same exercise, the AI connected to
OL,16,Fthe internet and breached the systems
OL,17,Fof three real organisations instead of
OL,18,Fthe intended test environment, the San
OL,19,FFrancisco-based company said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
