CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FA similar incident occurred at OpenAI
OL,7,Flast week.
OL,9,FWhile testing a new AI model's hacking
OL,10,Fabilities, researchers removed its
OL,11,Fusual safety restrictions inside a
OL,12,Fsealed testing environment, known as a
OL,13,Fsandbox.
OL,15,FOpenAI said the AI exploited a
OL,16,Fpreviously unknown security
OL,17,Fvulnerability to escape the sandbox
OL,18,Fand move through the company's
OL,19,Finternal systems until it gained
OL,20,Finternet access, something it should
OL,21,Fnot have done.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
