FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FOnce online, the model concluded that
OL,7,FHugging Face - a platform hosting
OL,8,Fthousands of open-source AI models and
OL,9,Fdatasets - was likely to contain the
OL,10,Finformation needed to complete its
OL,11,Ftask.
OL,13,FIt then breached Hugging Face's
OL,14,Fproduction servers and extracted the
OL,15,Fdata required to solve the exercise.
OL,17,FHugging Face detected the intrusion
OL,18,Findependently before learning it had
OL,19,Foriginated from an OpenAI test.
OL,21,FHow did it happen?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FNeither Anthropic nor OpenAI has fully
OL,7,Fdisclosed how the breaches were
OL,8,Fcarried out, but both companies have
OL,9,Frevealed some details.
OL,11,FAnthropic said its AI models relied on
OL,12,Frelatively basic hacking techniques to
OL,13,Fgain access to the three unnamed
OL,14,Forganisations' systems.
OL,16,FThese included exploiting weak
OL,17,Fpasswords and identifying services or
OL,18,Fsystem entry points that did not
OL,19,Frequire logins or authentication
OL,20,Ftokens.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
