CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FOpenAI revealed that its AI agent
OL,7,Ffound four sets of login credentials
OL,8,Favailable online, allowing it to
OL,9,Faccess four separate, unnamed services.
OL,11,FThe company also said the model used
OL,12,Fstolen credentials and exploited a
OL,13,Fpreviously unknown software
OL,14,Fvulnerability to gain access to
OL,15,FHugging Face's servers.
OL,17,FShould we be worried?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FCybersecurity experts have warned that
OL,7,Fmore incidents like these could happen
OL,8,Fin the future, with some saying there
OL,9,Fare legitimate reasons for concern.
OL,11,FKok Tin Gan, co-founder and CEO of
OL,12,Fcybersecurity firm NyxLab, which
OL,13,Fspecialises in cybersecurity and
OL,14,Fthreat detection, said the focus must
OL,15,Fincreasingly shift towards controlling
OL,16,Fwhat AI can access, what permissions
OL,17,Fit has and which actions require human
OL,18,Fapproval.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,F"It is increasingly about governing
OL,7,Fwhat agents are available to the AI,
OL,8,Fwhat authorities they possess, which
OL,9,Factions require approval, and how we
OL,10,Fensure they remain within scope," Gan
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FHe warned that AI safety is not only
OL,14,Fabout securing the models themselves,
OL,15,Fbut also about how organisations
OL,16,Fdeploy and manage them.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
