OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785516479
OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,F"If we simply give the AI a goal and
OL,7,Fallow it to decide how to achieve it,
OL,8,Fwe should not be surprised when it
OL,9,Ftakes actions that technically satisfy
OL,10,Fthe objective, but fall outside our
OL,11,Fintended scope or expectations," he
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FGan added that stronger government
OL,15,Fcontrol of these organisations
OL,16,Fdeveloping and deploying AI systems
OL,17,Fwill become more important as the
OL,18,Ftechnology becomes more powerful.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
