OL,3,CWhy experts are warning about AI
OL,4,Cautonomously launching cyber attacks
OL,6,FAI pioneer Yoshua Bengio also
OL,7,Fdescribed the OpenAI incident as
OL,8,F"deeply concerning" and a "wake-up
OL,9,Fcall".
OL,11,F"Continuing on the current trajectory
OL,12,Fof AI development will likely lead to
OL,13,Fan increase in concrete cases of
OL,14,Fautonomous cyberattacks as well as
OL,15,Fother high-risk incidents of
OL,16,Fmisaligned and dangerous AI
OL,17,Fbehaviour," Bengio, a professor at the
OL,18,FUniversity of Montreal, said.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@SO]pD@[OUqD@EO]sD@AOUyD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
